; One directional light only, without shadows: on the Mobile renderer (as
; seen on the software Vulkan used for screenshots) a second directional
; light, or a shadowed one next to the rooms' omni lights, made the key light
; drop out entirely. The sky's ambient light does the fill's job and the baked
; ambient occlusion in every model grounds props on the floor.
